[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":317},["Reactive",2],{"page-document:/book/minecraft":3},{"_path":4,"_dir":5,"_draft":6,"_partial":6,"_locale":7,"title":8,"description":7,"director":9,"time":10,"img":11,"plan":12,"body":13,"_type":275,"_id":276,"_source":277,"_file":278,"_extension":279,"sitemap":280,"head":282},"/book/minecraft","book",false,"","Minecraft","My","2025","minecraft/1.png","100,100",{"type":14,"children":15,"toc":271},"root",[16],{"type":17,"tag":18,"props":19,"children":24},"element","book-content",{":by":20,":img":21,":plan":22,":title":23},"director","img","plan","title",[25,30,37,42,58,63,95,105,160,164,173,177,179],{"type":17,"tag":26,"props":27,"children":29},"text-title",{":t":28},"第一次玩 Minecraft",[],{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":32,"children":33},"p",{},[34],{"type":35,"value":36},"text","还记得我第一次玩 Minecraft 的时候，还是在小学，同学来我家帮我注册邮箱. 记得当时有很多启动器, 里面有很多服务器可以选择. 我影响比较深的就是多玩我的世界盒子和麦块(好像是叫这个名字). 到之后加 QQ 群下载启动器 Hello Minecraft! Launcher(那个时候还不知道是这个) 我影响最深的版本就是 1.7.10 玩了很久这个版本, 同时也进到了很多好玩的生存服务器. 记得那时候最幸福的就是买地皮, 和邻居互相认识.",{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":38,"children":39},{},[40],{"type":35,"value":41},"那时还不知什么是 RPG, 只知道很好玩, 可以刷金币兑换比较厉害的武器. 玩小服务器的时候服主叫 \"腐竹\", 有管理权限的叫 op, 五块钱六块就能买个 op 体验创世主的快乐. 不过我没有买, 白嫖到了一个 op 玩. 我觉得 Minecraft 这个游戏很注重引导, 例如那时我根本不知道 Java 是什么, 只知道玩 Minecraft 需要安装 Java. 印象最深的就是 Java 那个进度条和那个红色的背景.",{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":43,"children":44},{},[45,47,56],{"type":35,"value":46},"十个好多年再次玩 Minecraft 才发现启动时那个铁砧 Logo 是 ",{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":49,"children":53},"a",{"href":50,"rel":51},"https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/",[52],"nofollow",[54],{"type":35,"value":55},"forge",{"type":35,"value":57},", 光影能接触到 shader, 这个还是我最近混进类似游戏上下游才知道的. 例如 unity shader. 而材质\\ Mod 能接触到 Java 和 Minecraft Forge",{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":59,"children":60},{},[61],{"type":35,"value":62},"毕竟地域和末地去过了, 也打完末影龙了, 觉得一个人玩没有意思了. 于是就加入到某个服务器和别人一起玩. 但是有些服务器吃相太难看了, 于是就开始琢磨联机. 我那时比较流行花生壳进行内网穿透(工作后发现向日葵也是他们家的). 或者用游侠. 更有甚者租用服务器, 接触 Ubuntu / Debian / RHEL 这些 Linux Server version.",{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":64,"children":65},{},[66,68,75,77,84,86,93],{"type":35,"value":67},"即使加入服务器,也需要输入 ",{"type":17,"tag":69,"props":70,"children":72},"code",{"className":71},[],[73],{"type":35,"value":74}," IP:PORT",{"type":35,"value":76}," , Minecraft 无时无刻都在引导玩家接触这些计算机领域中的技术. 可谓是最好的领路人. 根据我的统计, 很多较为 niubbity 的大佬都有游玩过甚至是为 Minecraft 创建 Mod 的经历. 例如 ",{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":78,"children":81},{"href":79,"rel":80},"https://github.com/Glavo",[52],[82],{"type":35,"value":83},"Glavo",{"type":35,"value":85}," \\ ",{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":87,"children":90},{"href":88,"rel":89},"https://github.com/Ry0taK",[52],[91],{"type":35,"value":92},"Ry0taK",{"type":35,"value":94},".",{"type":17,"tag":96,"props":97,"children":99},"wise-info",{"by":98,"topic":8},"wikipedia",[100],{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":101,"children":102},{},[103],{"type":35,"value":104},"Minecraft has been used in educational environments to teach chemistry, computer-aided design, and computer science.",{"type":17,"tag":31,"props":106,"children":107},{},[108,110,117,118,125,126,133,134,141,142,149,151,158],{"type":35,"value":109},"也有很多和 Minecraft 相关的开源项目, 例如 ",{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":111,"children":114},{"href":112,"rel":113},"https://papermc.io/",[52],[115],{"type":35,"value":116},"PaperMC",{"type":35,"value":85},{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":119,"children":122},{"href":120,"rel":121},"https://fabricmc.net/",[52],[123],{"type":35,"value":124},"FabricMC",{"type":35,"value":85},{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":127,"children":130},{"href":128,"rel":129},"https://prismarinejs.github.io/",[52],[131],{"type":35,"value":132},"PrismarineJS",{"type":35,"value":85},{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":135,"children":138},{"href":136,"rel":137},"https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium",[52],[139],{"type":35,"value":140},"sodium",{"type":35,"value":85},{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":143,"children":146},{"href":144,"rel":145},"https://github.com/IrisShaders/Iris",[52],[147],{"type":35,"value":148},"Iris",{"type":35,"value":150}," . 一步一步吸引着玩家进行探索\\创造. 无愧于 ",{"type":17,"tag":48,"props":152,"children":155},{"href":153,"rel":154},"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_video_games_considered_the_best",[52],[156],{"type":35,"value":157},"List of video games considered the best",{"type":35,"value":159}," 不过对于我来说, 我并未在小时候就接触到 Mod 的开发和 shader, 而是被 Hacker 所吸引, 因为很 Cool (误入歧途了属于是). 不敢想象我如果一开始就走 Minecraft 这条线会变成什么样.",{"type":17,"tag":161,"props":162,"children":163},"hr",{},[],{"type":17,"tag":165,"props":166,"children":170},"h2",{"id":167,"data-toc-marker":168,"data-toc-count":169,"aria-hidden":168},"常用命令-2","true","2",[171],{"type":35,"value":172},"常用命令 2",{"type":17,"tag":26,"props":174,"children":176},{":t":175},"常用命令",[],{"type":35,"value":178},"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",{"type":17,"tag":180,"props":181,"children":182},"table",{},[183,202],{"type":17,"tag":184,"props":185,"children":186},"thead",{},[187],{"type":17,"tag":188,"props":189,"children":190},"tr",{},[191,197],{"type":17,"tag":192,"props":193,"children":194},"th",{},[195],{"type":35,"value":196},"name",{"type":17,"tag":192,"props":198,"children":199},{},[200],{"type":35,"value":201},"info",{"type":17,"tag":203,"props":204,"children":205},"tbody",{},[206,220,241,254],{"type":17,"tag":188,"props":207,"children":208},{},[209,215],{"type":17,"tag":210,"props":211,"children":212},"td",{},[213],{"type":35,"value":214},"/gamerule keepInventory true",{"type":17,"tag":210,"props":216,"children":217},{},[218],{"type":35,"value":219},"死亡不掉落",{"type":17,"tag":188,"props":221,"children":222},{},[223,236],{"type":17,"tag":210,"props":224,"children":225},{},[226,228,234],{"type":35,"value":227},"/tp @e",{"type":17,"tag":229,"props":230,"children":231},"span",{},[232],{"type":35,"value":233},"type=item",{"type":35,"value":235}," @s",{"type":17,"tag":210,"props":237,"children":238},{},[239],{"type":35,"value":240},"传送所有掉落物到自身",{"type":17,"tag":188,"props":242,"children":243},{},[244,249],{"type":17,"tag":210,"